<view class="page result-page">
  <view class="safe-top"></view>
  <view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">安全建议</view><view class="top-title-sub">第 4 步，共 4 步</view></view></view>
  <view class="card result-hero" style="border-color:{{info.color}}">
    <view class="row"><view class="score-ring" style="border-color:{{info.color}}"><image wx:if="{{level==='observe'}}" class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgFrame1.svg"/><image wx:else class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s06-img1.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="h2" style="color:{{info.color}}">{{info.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{info.sub}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="immediate-action">{{info.action}}</view>
    <view class="tiny" wx:if="{{level==='emergency'}}">请让身边的人协助；不要自行驾车就医。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{level!=='emergency'}}" class="notice notice-red escalation" bindtap="emergency"><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-img1.svg"/><view>呼吸困难、意识异常、面口咽肿胀或快速扩散<view class="tiny">立即求助，不必等待复查 · 点击重新筛查</view></view></view>
  <view class="section-title">本次判断依据</view>
  <view class="card card-pad rationale"><view wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="id">{{item.text}}</view><view wx:if="{{!rules.length}}">根据本次填写的表现和变化，暂未触发升级规则。这不代表已经排除疾病或后续风险。</view><view class="tiny">图片候选和他人经历不参与降低风险级别。</view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{steps.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">接下来怎么做</view>
    <view class="stack gap-8"><view wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="title" class="card card-pad row"><view class="circle circle-green step">{{index+1}}</view><view class="grow"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.detail}}</view></view></view></view>
  </block>
  <view class="expand-card" bindtap="toggleSummary"><view class="between"><view><view class="h3">就医沟通摘要</view><view class="tiny">复诊时可向急救人员或医疗专业人员说明本次事实。</view></view><text class="expand-toggle">{{summaryOpen?'收起 ⌃':'展开 ⌄'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{summaryOpen}}" class="expand-content"><view wx:for="{{summaryLines}}" wx:key="*this" class="summary-line">{{item}}</view><button class="outline-action" bindtap="copySummary">复制完整摘要</button></view></view>
  <view class="expand-card" bindtap="toggleRecord"><view class="between"><view><view class="h3">本次记录清单</view><view class="tiny">已填写的信息与可补充的线索。</view></view><text class="expand-toggle">{{recordOpen?'收起 ⌃':'展开 ⌄'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{recordOpen}}" class="expand-content"><view wx:for="{{recordLines}}" wx:key="*this" class="summary-line">{{item}}</view><view wx:if="{{!recordLines.length}}" class="tiny">暂未填写其他补充信息。</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{level==='observe'}}" class="review-card"><view class="between"><view class="h3">下次复查</view><button class="text-button" disabled="{{!saved}}" bindtap="adjustReview">调整时间</button></view><view>{{reviewLabel || '保存后可设置'}}</view><view class="tiny">仅记录时间，尚未开启微信通知。有新症状请立即重新判断，不等提醒。</view></view>
  <view class="result-action-bar"><button class="{{level==='emergency'?'danger-btn':'primary-btn'}}" bindtap="primaryAction">{{primaryActionLabel}}</button><view class="action-links"><text wx:if="{{allowStepBack}}" bindtap="modifyAnswers">修改本次回答</text><text bindtap="events">查看本次记录</text><text bindtap="home">返回首页</text></view></view>
  <view class="safe-note">{{saved?'事件已保存到本机，尚未同步云端':'记录未保存，不影响查看建议或拨打 120'}}</view><button wx:if="{{!saved}}" class="text-button" bindtap="saveEvent">重试保存记录</button>
  <view class="safe-note result-disclaimer">结果为课程演示的安全分流，不构成医疗诊断。</view>
</view>
